# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This project does NOT read .env in the browser (static site).
# API keys are stored in Cloudflare Worker secrets, not here.
#
# After deploying your Worker at workers.cloudflare.com:
#   1. Open your Worker → Settings → Variables and Secrets
#   2. Add secret: name = PSI_API_KEY, value = your Google PageSpeed API key
#   Or via CLI: npx wrangler secret put PSI_API_KEY
#
# Optional: use .env only for local wrangler dev (e.g. wrangler dev --local)
# and reference in wrangler.toml. Never commit .env.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# PSI_API_KEY=your_google_pagespeed_api_key_here
